      "text": "Saipan, my home for 24 years! Originally from the Philippines, came to Saipan in 2000 to teach at Grace Christian Academy for 21 years before moving to public school at Oleai Elementary School. I always cherish those beautiful years.🌴 Saipan: The Island That Became My Second Home\n\nWhen I moved to Saipan in 2000, I was beginning another adventure.\n\nWhat started as a new chapter became 24 years of island life, teaching, friendships, and unforgettable memories.\n\nSaipan was more than a place where I worked. It became home.\nI MISS THE YOUNG COCONUTS IN SAIPAN! 🥥🤣\n\nThat fresh coconut water and soft, sweet coconut meat!",
      "likeCount": 8,
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T18:44:52Z",
      "replyCount": 2,
      "replies": [
